        <div class="scene-copy"><span class="scene-number">09 · REPORT</span><h2>StockChief handled the routine work. You handled one decision.</h2><p>The owner sees what completed, what changed, and the evidence behind it—without reconstructing the day across six systems.</p><div class="pub-actions"><a class="pub-btn" href="/register">Start with StockChief</a><a class="pub-btn pub-btn--secondary" href="/capabilities">Explore capabilities</a></div></div>
